{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Leisure Time", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Something for Everyone", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 6, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 17, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "  Describe  routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "  Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "entertainment", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a performance  people enjoy watching", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: One of the most popular forms of entertainment is watching movies. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about forms of entertainment.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "imagination", "type": "name"}, {"content": "creative thought", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Every time we watch a movie, we use our imagination.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "special effects", "type": "name"}, {"content": "scenes for a movie or television show that involve the use of technology to make something unusual happen", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Special effects can bring the most outrageous aliens to our planet.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to draw crowds", "type": "name"}, {"content": "bring people to see something, like a performance", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Live theater also continues to draw crowds. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob06aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "scenario", "type": "name"}, {"content": "future situation", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Science fiction movies show us the best and the worst scenarios for the future.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob06aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "play", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a story told on a stage by live actors in front of an audience", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: On the stage, performers make a play come alive.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob06aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "musical", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a play with some music", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I enjoyed the musical Les Miserables. Have you seen it?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob06aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob06re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Superlatives", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use a superlative adjectives to  compare something to a group of two or more things. Remember that a comparative, on the other hand compares something to another thing.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "One of  <span class=\"strong\"> the  most</span> popular forms of entertainment is watching movies.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Special effects can make <span class=\"strong\">the tiniest</span> animals speak, cause <span class=\"strong\">the wildest</span> storms and show us <span class=\"strong\">the best</span> and <span class=\"strong\">the worst</span> scenarios for the future.", "type": "example"}, {"content": " For regular adjectives that are one syllable, you usually add <span class=\"strong\"> the</span> before the adjective and <span class=\"strong\">-est</span>  to the adjective to make the superlative form. <br/> For regular adjectives of two or more syllables, you usually add <span class=\"strong\">the most</span> before the adjective. Find examples of regular superlatives in the chart below.", "type": "text"}, {"content": " Irregular adjectives are unpredictable in their superlative forms. Common irregular adjectives are <span class=\"italic\"> good</span> and <span class=\"italic\">bad</span>. Find their superlatives in the chart below.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Superlative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"good\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" the best\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bad\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" the worst\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tiny\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" the tiniest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"wild\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" the wildest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"beautiful\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" the most beautiful\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"outrageous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" the most outrageous\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Adverbs of Manner", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Adverbs of manner tell us how something happens. Sometimes an adverb of manner is placed before a verb + object to add emphasis.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Example: <ul><li><span class = \"italic product-color-text\">Every time we eagerly watch a movie ...</span></li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "It is possible to find a sentence with more than one adverb, and each placed in a different position.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <ul><li><span class = \"italic product-color-text\">Special effects can mysteriously bring the most outrageous aliens to our planet, make the tiniest animals speak cheerfully and suddenly cause the wildest storms.</span></li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Many adverbs are formed by adding <span class=\"italic\">-ly</span> to an adjective: ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Examples: <br/>mysterious \u2013 mysteriously</br>cheerful \u2013 cheerfully</br>sudden \u2013 suddenly", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Some adverbs, like <span class=\"italic\">basically</span> or <span class=\"italic\">generally</span>, are often placed at the beginning of the sentence. You use a comma after the adverb.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "One meaning of the word entertain is to warmly welcome a person into your home.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Movies can mysteriously bring the most outrageous aliens to our planet.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "With a partner, discuss different forms of entertainment. Ask your partner which form of entertainment he or she prefers.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Try to name 5 different examples (name of movie, play, etc.) of each form of entertainment. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Complete the table below with the examples.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Discuss which example is the best in each category.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Circle the one you chose.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":5,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Movies\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Plays\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Operas\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Musicals\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Ballets\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <br><br>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <br><br> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <br><br>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <br><br>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <br><br>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I discuss different forms of entertainment.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a list of examples.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I choose which one is the best and discuss why.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn6le17ob06re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le17ob06re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "One meaning of the word entertain is to warmly welcome a person into your home. Every time we eagerly watch a movie, a play, or a television show, we enter a different kind of house \u2013 the house of imagination."}, {"image": "engenn6le17ob06re2img02.jpg", "time": "13000", "id": 2, "text": "One of the most popular forms of entertainment is watching movies. A good movie can make us laugh and cry, frighten, and surprise us, all in about two hours.  Special effects can mysteriously bring the most outrageous aliens to our planet, make the tiniest animals speak cheerfully and suddenly cause the wildest storms. They show us the best outcomes for the future, but they also display the worst scenarios."}, {"image": "engenn6le17ob06re2img03.jpg", "time": "38000", "id": 3, "text": "Live theater also remains a form of entertainment that continues to draw crowds. On the stage in front of the audience, performers make a play, musical, opera, or ballet come alive. There is nothing like the moments before the curtain rises and the performance begins. It is true that the stage is a world of its own.\n<br/>\n<br/>\nThere is something for everyone!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le17ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le17ob06re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "text", "contents": [], "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can talk about free time activities.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can describe the quality of an object or a person. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about how something happens or how someone behaves. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " How many forms of entertainment (movies, television, etc.) can you identify? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What form do you prefer?  Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " Let me entertain you!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "id": 0, "_data": [{"con